Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:06:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] feat(web): show context usage with a smooth
 compaction-aware meter

Render actual window occupancy in a rounded provider-accented track, with pressure-based warning colors, quarter marks, and a reported or configured compaction threshold marker. Share the meter with context details, retain token fallback and compact controls, and respect reduced motion. Preserve the original segmented-meter helper coverage and test threshold validity separately.
